flowchart TD
    accTitle: Resource identity and retirement
    accDescr: Scene resource ownership, server RID ownership, device RID ownership, and native GPU retirement are distinct.
    Resource[Scene Resource with Ref ownership] -->|creates or references| RS[Server RID record]
    RS -->|storage creates or views| RD[Device RID record]
    RD -->|driver identity| Native[Native allocation or view]
    RS -.->|change notification| Tracker[Renderer dependency tracker]
    RD -.->|invalidation| Cache[Uniform set and framebuffer caches]
    Free[RD free request] --> Invalid[Remove device RID validity]
    Invalid --> Deferred[Frame disposal queue]
    Deferred -->|wait for slot completion| Release[Release native resource]
    Native -.->|still used by submitted work| Deferred
